{"bookId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY", "title": "A novel", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1695946267, "updated": [{"bookId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY", "bookmarkId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY_18_5421-5888", "createTime": 1695946267, "range": "5421-5888", "markText": "They ate in the dining hall, and then they had sex. Marx usually enjoyed the experience of making love to an ex, and this evening was no exception. It was interesting to note the way your body had changed and how their body had changed in the time since you’d last been intimate. There was a pleasant Weltschmerz that came over him. It was the nostalgia one experienced when visiting an old school and finding that the desks were so much smaller than in one’s memory.", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 18}, {"bookId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY", "bookmarkId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY_15_28967-28973", "createTime": 1693756453, "range": "28967-28973", "markText": "sublet", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15}, {"bookId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY", "bookmarkId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY_15_23348-23357", "createTime": 1693756134, "range": "23348-23357", "markText": "resentful", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15}, {"bookId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY", "bookmarkId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY_15_17540-17550", "createTime": 1693755625, "range": "17540-17550", "markText": "xenophobia", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15}, {"bookId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY", "bookmarkId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY_14_11962-11971", "createTime": 1693744953, "range": "11962-11971", "markText": "irritated", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 14}, {"bookId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY", "bookmarkId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY_12_37099-37444", "createTime": 1693741225, "range": "37099-37444", "markText": "Several hours later, he had finished the reading, which had been about Chinese immigration to America in the nineteenth and twentieth centuries, and how Chinese immigrants had only been allowed to do certain kinds of work, like food or cleaning, and that’s why there were so many Chinese restaurants and Chinese laundries, i.e., systemic racism.", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 12}, {"bookId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY", "bookmarkId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY_11_40713-40721", "createTime": 1693718289, "range": "40713-40721", "markText": "ruefully", "colorStyle": 1, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 11}, {"bookId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY", "bookmarkId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY_11_38844-38854", "createTime": 1693718178, "range": "38844-38854", "markText": "conversant", "colorStyle": 1, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 11}, {"bookId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY", "bookmarkId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY_11_37873-37957", "createTime": 1693718098, "range": "37873-37957", "markText": "Yes, she loved him, but she also liked him. She liked herself when she was with him.", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 11}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "Chapter 5", "chapterUid": 18, "chapterIdx": 18}, {"title": "Chapter 2", "chapterUid": 15, "chapterIdx": 15}, {"title": "Chapter 1", "chapterUid": 14, "chapterIdx": 14}, {"title": "Chapter 4", "chapterUid": 12, "chapterIdx": 12}, {"title": "Chapter 3", "chapterUid": 11, "chapterIdx": 11}], "book": {"bookId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY", "version": 1681170152, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_1pl2hR2giDZK6i26gW27O5FW_parsecover", "title": "A novel", "author": "Gabrielle Zevin", "coverBoxInfo": {"colorsPure": ["#93B0DA", "#98B8DD"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7L6wyU7Us", "review": {"bookId": "CB_Fi37iZ7iCEuE6iM6gX6ot4wY", "content": "The author of this novel have no ideas about programming for sure.", "bookVersion": 1681170152, "range": "1272-1670", "abstract": "With a major assist from Dov’s Ulysses engine, Sadie and Sam had programmed Ichigo, nonstop, until their fingers 